@startuml
title Bloater: Long Method -- AFTER (Refactored)

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #D4EDDA
skinparam ClassBorderColor #28A745
skinparam ClassFontSize 13
skinparam ClassAttributeFontSize 12

note "REFACTORED: Extract Method\nEach method does one thing" as N1 #69DB7C

class OrderProcessor <<Clean Code>> {
  - items : List<Item>
  - customer : Customer
  --
  + **processOrder(order : Order) : void**
  .. <color:#28A745>delegates to small methods:</color> ..
  --
  - validateOrder(order : Order) : void
  - calculateSubtotal(order : Order) : double
  - calculateTax(subtotal : double) : double
  - calculateShipping(subtotal : double) : double
  - applyDiscounts(order : Order, subtotal : double) : double
  - updateInventory(order : Order) : void
  - saveOrder(order : Order, total : double) : void
  - sendConfirmationEmail(order : Order, total : double) : void
}

N1 .. OrderProcessor

note bottom of OrderProcessor
  <color:#28A745><b>Benefits:</b></color>
  - Each method has a descriptive name
  - Easy to test individually
  - Single Responsibility per method
  - Duplicate code becomes visible
end note

@enduml
